{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-product","blocks":{"title":{"type":"title","settings":{}},"caption":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"{{ product.metafields.descriptors.subtitle.value }}","text_style":"subtitle"}},"834b2fdf-30f4-481e-af4b-3e868c96d932":{"type":"shopify://apps/yotpo-product-reviews/blocks/star-rating/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}},"price":{"type":"price","settings":{}},"description":{"type":"description","settings":{}},"variant_picker":{"type":"variant_picker","settings":{"picker_type":"button"}},"da8ef1d6-d5ee-4fd6-a726-7c6359134946":{"type":"link","settings":{"title":"{{ product.metafields.custom.link_to_title.value }}"}},"quantity_selector":{"type":"quantity_selector","settings":{}},"buy_buttons":{"type":"buy_buttons","settings":{"show_sticky_cart":true,"is_set":false,"only_tier_gang_button":"Required gang tier not reached","set_size":3,"set_text":"W\u00e4hle 3 Produkte","show_dynamic_checkout":false,"gang_url":""}},"recommended_products_YjjcwG":{"type":"recommended_products","settings":{"title":"Empfohlene Produkte","content":"","button_text":"","product_list":["vodka","aperitivo"],"enable_bulk_add":false,"columns_desktop":"2","enable_desktop_slider":true,"columns_mobile":"2","swipe_on_mobile":true}},"collapsible-row-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Beschreibung","icon":"clipboard","content":"<p>Der \"High Proof\u201c vereint die amerikanische Moonshine-Tradition mit deutscher Destillierkunst und ist etwas f\u00fcr echte Moonshiner. Verwendet werden nur die besten Zutaten und abgef\u00fcllt wird unser starker Schnaps in originalen Mason Jars. Der O\u2019Donnell Moonshine \"High Proof\u201c schmeckt nicht nur eisgek\u00fchlt und pur, sondern es lassen sich auch leckere\u00a0<a href=\"https://odonnell.de/blogs/cocktails/tagged/high-proof\" title=\"Vodka Cocktails von O'Donnell Moonshine\">Vodka Cocktails</a>\u00a0damit mixen.</p><p>Wenn du noch mehr<a href=\"https://odonnell.de/\">\u00a0</a><a href=\"https://odonnell.de/\" title=\"Hochwertiger Lik\u00f6r von O'Donnell Moonshine\">hochwertigen Lik\u00f6r</a>\u00a0entdecken m\u00f6chtest, wirf einfach einen Blick auf unsere anderen vielf\u00e4ltigen Moonshine-Sorten und werde Teil der\u00a0<a href=\"https://odonnell.de/pages/gang\" title=\"Komm in die Gang von O'Donnell Moonshine\">Moonshine-Gang</a>.\u00a0</p><p>Nat\u00fcrlich\u00a0enth\u00e4lt unser \u201cHigh Proof\u201d nur die besten Zutaten und keine kennzeichnungspflichtigen Allergene.</p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-3":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Cocktailvorschlag","icon":"bottle","content":"<h3>Basil Moonshine Smash</h3><h4>Zutaten</h4><ul><li>60ml\u00a0<a href=\"/products/high-proof-vodka\" title=\"High Proof - Vodka\">High Proof</a></li><li>20ml Zuckersirup</li><li>Limette</li><li>Basilikum</li></ul><h4>Zubereitung</h4><ol><li>Ein Tumbler Glas mit Eisw\u00fcrfeln f\u00fcllen.</li><li>Basilikumbl\u00e4tter, geviertelte Limette &\u00a0Zuckersirup in Shaker geben und zersto\u00dfen.</li><li><em>High Proof</em> und Eisw\u00fcrfel aus Tumbler hinzuf\u00fcgen und kr\u00e4ftig shaken.</li><li>Tumbler mit neuen Eisw\u00fcrfel f\u00fcllen und alles durch ein feines Sieb ins Glas ablassen.</li><li>Frische Basilikum-Bl\u00e4tter hinzuf\u00fcgen.</li><li>Servieren und genie\u00dfen!</li></ol><p>Mehr <a href=\"/blogs/cocktails\" title=\"Cocktails\">Moonshine-Cocktails</a>.</p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Komm in die O'Donnell Gang","icon":"silhouette","content":"<p>Werde Teil der <a href=\"/pages/gang\" title=\"Die O'Donnell Gang\">Moonshine-Gang</a>! Als Mitglied sammelst du mit jedem Kauf im Onlineshop Proof und kannst diese gegen gratis O\u2019Donnell Geschenke eintauschen. Au\u00dferdem hast du Zugang zu exklusiven Produkten und kannst im Gang-Rang immer weiter aufsteigen. Worauf wartest du also noch?\u00a0Wir schmuggeln dir den Schnaps direkt nach Hause \u2014 v\u00f6llig legal nat\u00fcrlich!</p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-0":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Versand","icon":"truck","content":"<ul><li><strong>DHL Priority: Lieferzeit 1-2 Werktage</strong></li></ul><p>Alle Bestellungen bis 12 Uhr werden noch am selben Tag DHL \u00fcbergeben.</p><ul><li><strong>DHL Standard: Lieferzeit 2-3 Werktage</strong></li></ul>","page":""}},"delivery_badge_default":{"type":"delivery_badge","settings":{"delivery_text":"Delivery 1-2"}}},"block_order":["title","caption","834b2fdf-30f4-481e-af4b-3e868c96d932","price","delivery_badge_default","description","variant_picker","da8ef1d6-d5ee-4fd6-a726-7c6359134946","quantity_selector","buy_buttons","recommended_products_YjjcwG","collapsible-row-2","collapsible-row-3","collapsible-row-1","collapsible-row-0"],"custom_css":[".product-form__input label:nth-of-type(3) {display: none !important;}"],"settings":{"gift_card_receipient_enabled":false,"is_above_the_fold":true,"enable_sticky_info":true,"badges_enabled":false,"gallery_layout":"thumbnail","media_size":"small","mobile_thumbnails":"hide","hide_variants":true,"enable_video_looping":false,"padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":12}},"image-with-text":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"image-with-text-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Glasklar und starker Charakter","heading_size":"h2"}},"image-with-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Unser \"High Proof\" ist etwas f\u00fcr ganz besondere Moonshiner. Hier trifft die alte amerikanische Moonshine-Tradition auf deutsche Destillierkunst.</p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["image-with-text-0","image-with-text-1"],"custom_css":["@media screen and (max-width: 750px) {.image-with-text__heading {font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; } .image-with-text__content {padding: 3rem calc(2rem / var(--font-body-scale)) 3rem; } .image-with-text__text {text-align: start; }}"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify: